## WHAT NOT TO RETRY
- DON'T blind-approve "newest" ref version. "X ок" = the EXISTING canonical (metelka) frame. I
  approved newest for SH14 → invalidated the correct metelka + pushed wrong v03 to video. Identify
  the metelka frame by marker+date; let Director approve manually.
- DON'T trust the "465 wakes → $135-225/episode" Opus estimate — WRONG scope. Real auto-react ≈ 0/ep.
- DON'T launch dev+inngest in ONE combined `nohup &` command on Windows — inngest dies → 500 "fetch
  failed". Launch inngest separately.
- DON'T over-direct one element in gpt-image-2 prompts (phone) — starves anatomy. Advisory + anatomy
  counter-directive.

